<TextPage lang="en" title="Privacy policy" altUrl="/es/privacidad/">
  <p class="todo">Provisional text pending review by the ULPGC data protection office.</p>
  <h2>What data is collected</h2>
  <p>
    Only what you send when you subscribe by email: your email address, your name, the language you want to receive
    the newsletter in and, if you choose to share them, your professional profile and your country.
  </p>
  <h2>What it is used for</h2>
  <p>
    Only to send you the weekly Goat Science summary. Your profile and country, if given, are only used to understand
    who reads the blog. Your data is not used for any other purpose or shared with third parties.
  </p>
  <h2>How the newsletter is sent</h2>
  <p>
    The newsletter is sent from a University of Las Palmas de Gran Canaria email account, with all recipients in blind
    copy. No subscriber can see anyone else's address. No external newsletter service is used.
  </p>
  <h2>How long it is kept</h2>
  <p>For as long as you stay subscribed. When you unsubscribe, your details are removed from the mailing list.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can unsubscribe, access, correct or ask for your data to be deleted at any time by writing to
    <a href="mailto:tacho@ulpgc.es">tacho@ulpgc.es</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>This website uses no tracking cookies or analytics tools.</p>
</TextPage>
